{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeNpKHHoQjq9Ut1r7tx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Step 1: The request**\n- Request ID: DR-9001\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- Requested discount: 15.0%\n- Request date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- Basis: Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement (contract-based)\n\n**Step 2: The customer**\nCRM account CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) matches ERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings); DUNS 04-812-7730 confirmed across systems.\n\n**Step 3: The product**\nSKU NS-500, list price $250,000; requested 15% discount = $37,500 (verified against record).\n\n**Step 4: Active contract**\nACME-MFG-2025 is in force on 2026-09-23 (term: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31). ✓\nThe contract covers NS-500 and grants up to 15% pricing eligibility (Section 3.2, Schedule B).\n\n**Step 5: Pricing exception**\nEXC-ACME-NS500-15 is registered and in force on 2026-09-23 (2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31).\n- Product: NS-500 only ✓\n- Customer: Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048) ✓\n- Maximum discount: 15% of list price ✓\n\nCommercial eligibility is established. The requested 15% is within the maximum.\n\nCritical note: EXC-ACME-NS500-15 states \"This exception establishes commercial eligibility only. It does not grant approval authority to any Northstar employee.\" And ACME-MFG-2025 Section 3.3 confirms: \"Customer's contractual pricing eligibility does not modify Northstar's internal approval authority.\"\n\n**Step 6: Policy in force**\nRequest date 2026-09-23 falls within PRICING-POLICY-2026 (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n**Step 7: Requestor's approval authority**\nSarah Chen holds the title **Enterprise Account Executive** (from employees.csv).\n\nUnder PRICING-POLICY-2026, Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts **up to and including 10%**.\n\nRequested discount: **15%** → exceeds Sarah Chen's authority ✗\n\n**Step 8: Required approver**\nFor discounts >10% and ≤20%, PRICING-POLICY-2026 requires **VP Sales** approval.\n\nVP Sales role: **Michael Torres** (EMP-200, manager to Sarah Chen).\n\n**Step 9: Decision**\n- ✓ Eligibility is established (pricing exception + active contract)\n- ✓ Discount does not exceed customer's commercial eligibility (15% = maximum)\n- ✗ Discount exceeds requestor's personal authority (15% > 10%)\n- Outcome: **APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION** — Michael Torres (VP Sales) must approve.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception under ACME-MFG-2025)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (in effect 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 (active contract, 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (15% maximum on NS-500, 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026 (APP-MATRIX-2026)\",\n    \"CRM record DR-9001\",\n    \"Employee records: Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive), Michael Torres (VP Sales)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5926,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral